{"id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-model.md","title":"Model (Structure)","display":"df-model — Model (Structure)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-model","aliases":["92-df-model"],"display":"df-model — Model (Structure)","depends_on":["[[92-df-interpretation]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model — Model (Structure)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(A\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> (nonempty domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(a_0,s,p,m,e)\\in\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(a_0,s,p,m,e)\\in\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\\)</span> (interpretation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(A)\\)</span> (assignment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> (assignment agreeing with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> off <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> and sending <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta},\\models_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta},\\models_G\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\mathcal I)\\mid A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal I\\in\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\quad\n\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(A),\\quad |\\mathfrak M|\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to A,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(0)=a_0,\\quad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(x)=\\beta(x),\\quad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(S(t))=s(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(t)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u+v)=p(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u),\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(v)),\\quad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u\\cdot v)=m(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u),\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(v)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(u=v)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u),\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(v))\\in e,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\neg\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\land(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\lor(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models_G\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models_G\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\mathcal I)\\mid A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal I\\in\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\quad\n\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(A),\\quad |\\mathfrak M|\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to A,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(0)=a_0,\\quad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(x)=\\beta(x),\\quad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(S(t))=s(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(t)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u+v)=p(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u),\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(v)),\\quad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u\\cdot v)=m(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u),\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(v)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(u=v)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(u),\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,\\beta}(v))\\in e,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\neg\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\land(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\lor(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models_G\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models_G\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}\\)</span>：模型/结构，由论域和解释组成</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak{M}|\">\\(|\\mathfrak{M}|\\)</span>：论域（非空集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{I}\">\\(\\mathcal{I}\\)</span>：解释函数，将常量、函数、谓词映射到论域上的元素/运算/关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak{M} \\models \\varphi\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}\\)</span>中为真（满足关系）</li>\n<li>标准模型<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>是PA的一个模型</li>\n<li>非标准模型：满足PA但不同构于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span></li>\n<li>模型是语义概念的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal I=(a_0,s,p,m,e)\\in\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)$ (interpretation, see [[92-df-interpretation]])","embed":false},{"targ